## 10. Integration Preparation

The ML-KEM module will be designed to support integration with the other QuantumVault components.

The following outputs and interfaces will be made available:

- Encapsulation key.
- Decapsulation key.
- Shared secret.
- KEM ciphertext.
- Standardized function interfaces.
- Structured error handling.

These interfaces will provide the foundation for Week 2, during which HKDF-SHA-256 and AES-256-GCM will be implemented.

Coordination with the filesystem and application developers will also be carried out to ensure compatibility with their respective modules.

